<h2>10. Common pitfalls &amp; anti-patterns</h2>
<ol>
  <li>
    <p><strong>Using Arbitrary Sleep Statements (time.sleep())</strong></p>
    <pre><code># ANTI-PATTERN: Brittle, wasteful arbitrary sleeping
